description=Diagnostic tracer + prop-level environment harmonizer for DroidGuard/Play Integrity on redroid. Logs the signals DroidGuard reads and normalizes the proppable ones. Deeper (sensor/kernel/keystore) harmonization needs the Zygisk component (see README).
